{"seq":1,"slug":"macro-fundamentals","title":"宏基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/macro-fundamentals","wordCount":1191,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"宏基础\">宏基础</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Swift 5.9 引入的宏（Macros）系统为语言带来了编译期元编程能力。宏可以在编译阶段生成代码，消除样板代码，同时保持完整的类型安全和编译器检查。与 C 预处理器宏不同，Swift 宏是类型安全的、可调试的，并且通过独立的编译器插件进程运行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    M[&quot;Swift 宏系统&quot;] --&gt; FS[&quot;独立宏 Freestanding&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; AT[&quot;附加宏 Attached&quot;]&#10;    FS --&gt; EX[&quot;#expression&quot;]&#10;    FS --&gt; DC[&quot;#declaration&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; MB[&quot;@member&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; AC[&quot;@accessor&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; EXT[&quot;@extension&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; PR[&quot;@peer&quot;]&#10;    AT --&gt; BD[&quot;@body&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    M[\"Swift 宏系统\"] --&gt; FS[\"独立宏 Freestanding\"]\n    M --&gt; AT[\"附加宏 Attached\"]\n    FS --&gt; EX[\"#expression\"]\n    FS --&gt; DC[\"#declaration\"]\n    AT --&gt; MB[\"@member\"]\n    AT --&gt; AC[\"@accessor\"]\n    AT --&gt; EXT[\"@extension\"]\n    AT --&gt; PR[\"@peer\"]\n    AT --&gt; BD[\"@body\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Swift 5.9 引入的宏（Macros）为语言带来<strong>编译期元编程</strong>能力：它在编译阶段生成代码、消除样板，同时保持完整类型安全。与 C 预处理器宏的文本替换不同，Swift 宏操作的是<strong>语法树</strong>，且运行在独立的编译器插件进程中。围绕它有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两大类别</strong>——独立宏（<code>#macroName</code>，独立出现生成表达式或声明）与附加宏（<code>@MacroName</code>，附着在已有声明上）；</li>\n<li><strong>宏角色（Role）</strong>——声明宏能力：<code>expression</code>、<code>declaration</code>、<code>member</code>、<code>accessor</code>、<code>extension</code>、<code>peer</code>、<code>body</code>、<code>memberAttribute</code>，一个宏可同时扮演多个角色；</li>\n<li><strong>SwiftSyntax 框架</strong>——提供源代码的语法树表示，宏接收语法树节点、返回新的语法树节点；</li>\n<li><strong>编译器插件架构</strong>——宏实现编译为独立可执行程序，编译器经进程间通信调用，实现安全与崩溃隔离；</li>\n<li><strong>展开过程</strong>——编译期完成，生成代码照常参与类型检查，生成的名称须通过 <code>names:</code> 显式列出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>Swift 宏是「类型安全的编译期代码生成」——它改的是语法树，跑在沙箱插件里，产出仍会被编译器严格检查。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"宏的两大类别\">宏的两大类别</h2><p>Swift 宏分为**独立宏（Freestanding Macros）<strong>和</strong>附加宏（Attached Macros）**两类，二者在语法和作用方式上有显著区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>语法前缀</th>\n<th>作用方式</th>\n<th>典型用例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>独立宏</td>\n<td><code>#macroName</code></td>\n<td>独立出现，生成表达式或声明</td>\n<td><code>#stringify</code>、<code>#warning</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加宏</td>\n<td><code>@MacroName</code></td>\n<td>附加到已有声明上</td>\n<td><code>@Observable</code>、<code>@CodingKeys</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>独立宏使用井号 <code>#</code> 作为前缀，可以出现在表达式或声明的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let (value, code) = #stringify(2 + 3)&#10;// value = 5, code = &quot;2 + 3&quot;&#10;&#10;#warning(&quot;This feature is incomplete&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (value, code) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> #stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// value = 5, code = \"2 + 3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#warning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"This feature is incomplete\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>附加宏使用 <code>@</code> 作为前缀，附着在类型、属性或函数等声明上：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@Observable&#10;class UserSettings {&#10;    var username = &quot;&quot;&#10;    var theme = &quot;light&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Observable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> username </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> theme </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"light\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"宏角色\">宏角色</h2><p>每个宏声明时必须指定一个或多个<strong>角色（Role）</strong>，角色决定了宏能在什么位置使用、能生成什么类型的代码：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@freestanding(expression)</code></td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>生成一个返回值的表达式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@freestanding(declaration)</code></td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>生成一个或多个声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@attached(member)</code></td>\n<td>附加</td>\n<td>向类型添加新成员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@attached(accessor)</code></td>\n<td>附加</td>\n<td>为属性添加 getter/setter 等访问器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@attached(extension)</code></td>\n<td>附加</td>\n<td>为类型添加扩展和协议遵循</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@attached(peer)</code></td>\n<td>附加</td>\n<td>在同级作用域生成新声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@attached(body)</code></td>\n<td>附加</td>\n<td>为函数或计算属性提供实现体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@attached(memberAttribute)</code></td>\n<td>附加</td>\n<td>为类型的现有成员添加属性标注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个宏可以同时扮演多个角色。例如 <code>@Observable</code> 同时使用 <code>@attached(member)</code> 和 <code>@attached(memberAttribute)</code> 和 <code>@attached(extension)</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@attached(member, names: named(_$observationRegistrar), named(access), named(withMutation))&#10;@attached(memberAttribute)&#10;@attached(extension, conformances: Observable)&#10;public macro Observable() = #externalMacro(module: &quot;ObservationMacros&quot;, type: &quot;ObservableMacro&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@attached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(member, names</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> named</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$observationRegistrar), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">named</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(access), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">named</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(withMutation))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@attached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(memberAttribute)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@attached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(extension, conformances</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Observable)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> macro</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Observable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> #externalMacro</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ObservationMacros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ObservableMacro\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"swiftsyntax-框架\">SwiftSyntax 框架</h2><p>宏的实现依赖 <strong>SwiftSyntax</strong> 框架，它提供了 Swift 源代码的语法树（Syntax Tree）表示。宏接收语法树节点作为输入，返回新的语法树节点作为展开结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    SC[&quot;源代码&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;Swift Parser&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; AST[&quot;语法树 SyntaxTree&quot;]&#10;    AST --&gt; MI[&quot;宏实现&quot;]&#10;    MI --&gt; NS[&quot;新语法树节点&quot;]&#10;    NS --&gt; GC[&quot;生成的代码&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    SC[\"源代码\"] --&gt; P[\"Swift Parser\"]\n    P --&gt; AST[\"语法树 SyntaxTree\"]\n    AST --&gt; MI[\"宏实现\"]\n    MI --&gt; NS[\"新语法树节点\"]\n    NS --&gt; GC[\"生成的代码\"]</pre><p>SwiftSyntax 的核心类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import SwiftSyntax&#10;import SwiftSyntaxMacros&#10;&#10;public struct StringifyMacro: ExpressionMacro {&#10;    public static func expansion(&#10;        of node: some FreestandingMacroExpansionSyntax,&#10;        in context: some MacroExpansionContext&#10;    ) -&gt; ExprSyntax {&#10;        guard let argument = node.arguments.first?.expression else {&#10;            fatalError(&quot;compiler bug: no argument&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        return &quot;(\\(argument), \\(literal: argument.description))&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SwiftSyntax</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SwiftSyntaxMacros</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StringifyMacro</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ExpressionMacro </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expansion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FreestandingMacroExpansionSyntax,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MacroExpansionContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ExprSyntax {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> argument </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.arguments.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.expression </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            fatalError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"compiler bug: no argument\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(argument)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(literal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> argument.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">description</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用语法节点类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ExprSyntax</code></td>\n<td>表达式节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DeclSyntax</code></td>\n<td>声明节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TypeSyntax</code></td>\n<td>类型节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PatternSyntax</code></td>\n<td>模式节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FunctionDeclSyntax</code></td>\n<td>函数声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>StructDeclSyntax</code></td>\n<td>结构体声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>VariableDeclSyntax</code></td>\n<td>变量声明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"编译器插件架构\">编译器插件架构</h2><p>Swift 宏通过**编译器插件（Compiler Plugin）**机制运行。宏的实现代码编译为独立的可执行程序，编译器通过进程间通信调用它：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Swift 编译器&quot;&#10;        CP[&quot;编译管线&quot;]&#10;        MR[&quot;宏解析&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;插件进程&quot;&#10;        MP[&quot;宏实现 (SwiftSyntax)&quot;]&#10;        ST[&quot;语法树操作&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    CP --&gt; MR&#10;    MR --&gt;|&quot;发送语法树&quot;| MP&#10;    MP --&gt; ST&#10;    ST --&gt;|&quot;返回展开结果&quot;| MR&#10;    MR --&gt; CP\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"Swift 编译器\"\n        CP[\"编译管线\"]\n        MR[\"宏解析\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"插件进程\"\n        MP[\"宏实现 (SwiftSyntax)\"]\n        ST[\"语法树操作\"]\n    end\n    CP --&gt; MR\n    MR --&gt;|\"发送语法树\"| MP\n    MP --&gt; ST\n    ST --&gt;|\"返回展开结果\"| MR\n    MR --&gt; CP</pre><p>这种沙箱架构的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>安全隔离</strong>：宏代码在独立进程中运行，无法访问编译器内部状态</li>\n<li><strong>崩溃隔离</strong>：宏进程崩溃不会导致编译器崩溃</li>\n<li><strong>可调试</strong>：可以对宏进程附加调试器</li>\n</ul>\n<p>宏包使用 Swift Package Manager 的 <code>.macro</code> 目标类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Package.swift&#10;let package = Package(&#10;    name: &quot;MyMacros&quot;,&#10;    dependencies: [&#10;        .package(url: &quot;https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-syntax.git&quot;, from: &quot;600.0.0&quot;),&#10;    ],&#10;    targets: [&#10;        .macro(&#10;            name: &quot;MyMacrosMacros&quot;,&#10;            dependencies: [&#10;                .product(name: &quot;SwiftSyntaxMacros&quot;, package: &quot;swift-syntax&quot;),&#10;                .product(name: &quot;SwiftCompilerPlugin&quot;, package: &quot;swift-syntax&quot;),&#10;            ]&#10;        ),&#10;        .target(name: &quot;MyMacros&quot;, dependencies: [&quot;MyMacrosMacros&quot;]),&#10;    ]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Package.swift</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> package</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyMacros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-syntax.git\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"600.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">macro</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyMacrosMacros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SwiftSyntaxMacros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"swift-syntax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SwiftCompilerPlugin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"swift-syntax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyMacros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyMacrosMacros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"宏展开过程\">宏展开过程</h2><p>宏的展开（Expansion）遵循确定的流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S1[&quot;1. 编译器解析源代码&quot;] --&gt; S2[&quot;2. 识别宏调用&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;3. 提取宏调用的语法树&quot;]&#10;    S3 --&gt; S4[&quot;4. 发送到插件进程&quot;]&#10;    S4 --&gt; S5[&quot;5. 宏实现处理语法树&quot;]&#10;    S5 --&gt; S6{&quot;生成诊断信息？&quot;}&#10;    S6 --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| S7[&quot;6a. 返回错误/警告&quot;]&#10;    S6 --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| S8[&quot;6b. 返回展开后的语法树&quot;]&#10;    S8 --&gt; S9[&quot;7. 编译器将展开结果插入 AST&quot;]&#10;    S9 --&gt; S10[&quot;8. 继续类型检查和编译&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    S1[\"1. 编译器解析源代码\"] --&gt; S2[\"2. 识别宏调用\"]\n    S2 --&gt; S3[\"3. 提取宏调用的语法树\"]\n    S3 --&gt; S4[\"4. 发送到插件进程\"]\n    S4 --&gt; S5[\"5. 宏实现处理语法树\"]\n    S5 --&gt; S6{\"生成诊断信息？\"}\n    S6 --&gt;|\"是\"| S7[\"6a. 返回错误/警告\"]\n    S6 --&gt;|\"否\"| S8[\"6b. 返回展开后的语法树\"]\n    S8 --&gt; S9[\"7. 编译器将展开结果插入 AST\"]\n    S9 --&gt; S10[\"8. 继续类型检查和编译\"]</pre><p>宏展开的关键特性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>展开在编译期完成，不影响运行时性能</li>\n<li>展开结果在 Xcode 中可以通过&quot;Expand Macro&quot;查看</li>\n<li>宏无法读取其他文件或执行 I/O 操作</li>\n<li>宏生成的名称需要在声明中通过 <code>names:</code> 参数显式列出</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@attached(member, names: named(init), named(description))&#10;public macro AutoInit() = #externalMacro(module: &quot;MyMacros&quot;, type: &quot;AutoInitMacro&quot;)&#10;&#10;@AutoInit&#10;struct Point {&#10;    var x: Double&#10;    var y: Double&#10;    // 宏展开生成:&#10;    // init(x: Double, y: Double) { self.x = x; self.y = y }&#10;    // var description: String { &quot;Point(x: \\(x), y: \\(y))&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@attached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(member, names</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> named</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">named</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(description))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> macro</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AutoInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> #externalMacro</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyMacros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AutoInitMacro\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@AutoInit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 宏展开生成:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // init(x: Double, y: Double) { self.x = x; self.y = y }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // var description: String { \"Point(x: \\(x), y: \\(y))\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Xcode 中右键点击宏调用，选择&quot;Expand Macro&quot;可以查看宏展开后的完整代码。这是调试和理解宏行为的最直观方式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Swift 宏分为<strong>独立宏</strong>（<code>#</code> 前缀）和<strong>附加宏</strong>（<code>@</code> 前缀）两大类</li>\n<li>宏通过<strong>角色</strong>声明能力，包括 expression、declaration、member、accessor、extension、peer、body 等</li>\n<li>宏实现基于 <strong>SwiftSyntax</strong> 框架，操作源代码的语法树</li>\n<li>宏运行在独立的<strong>编译器插件进程</strong>中，与编译器安全隔离</li>\n<li>宏展开在<strong>编译期</strong>完成，生成的代码经过完整的类型检查</li>\n<li>使用 Swift Package Manager 的 <code>.macro</code> 目标类型组织宏包</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"宏基础","id":"宏基础"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"宏的两大类别","id":"宏的两大类别"},{"level":2,"text":"宏角色","id":"宏角色"},{"level":2,"text":"SwiftSyntax 框架","id":"swiftsyntax-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"编译器插件架构","id":"编译器插件架构"},{"level":2,"text":"宏展开过程","id":"宏展开过程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"不安全指针","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/unsafe-pointers"},"next":{"title":"表达式宏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/macros-and-metaprogramming/expression-macros"}}